                        "entry_id": "123aa65a-9054-3590-88c3-980bec5d8b12",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A recidivist; one who backslides, especially in a religious sense; an apostate."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0af95573-b165-4cfc-99ff-39daef2a83dc",
                                "sense_id": "a2dcb7b2-3887-3403-a870-3ac2d439b8f7",
                                "text": "She married him thinking to change his ways, and for a while he got religion, but he was ever a backslider; she soon began finding bottles stashed about the house."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c22547af-3459-4024-8a3f-39c843c9eb81",
                                "sense_id": "a2dcb7b2-3887-3403-a870-3ac2d439b8f7",
                                "text": "At night the Red Elephant Tusk boomed and groaned among the hills, and the faithful waked and said: ‘The God of Things as They Are matures revenge against the backsliders.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "45d5586f-c19c-4d5f-9102-0fd330114b77",
                                "sense_id": "a2dcb7b2-3887-3403-a870-3ac2d439b8f7",
                                "text": "The choice of unilateralism by the US also exposed it to charges that it is a backslider on its WTO commitments."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c127866-36e2-48cf-bccf-a434e995ddf0",
                                "sense_id": "a2dcb7b2-3887-3403-a870-3ac2d439b8f7",
                                "text": "You say that you “lapse into coupledom” on occasion. Do you get grief from fellow militant singles for being a backslider?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fc11c62e-cfd7-313b-830e-43101fa22cad",
                        "entry_id": "123aa65a-9054-3590-88c3-980bec5d8b12",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who will not do his work or shoulder his responsiblities."
                        ],
